cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the version of Marmoset Atlas Mapper used in your research and its version-specific archive DOI."
type: software
title: "Marmoset Atlas Mapper"
version: "1.00"
authors:
  - family-names: Yagishita
    given-names: Haruya
repository-code: "https://github.com/H-Yagishita/Marmoset_CT-Atlas_Mapper"
url: "https://github.com/H-Yagishita/Marmoset_CT-Atlas_Mapper"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Marmoset Atlas Mapper maps a marmoset CT image to the Brain/MINDS Marmoset
  Brain Atlas 2.0 without an MRI of the target animal. It uses landmark-based
  or ANTs registration to six references and averages the resulting mappings.
  The application and reference library are distributed under the MIT License.
  BMA 2.0 and third-party software retain their own licenses.
keywords:
  - marmoset
  - brain atlas
  - CT
  - image registration
